<div class="college-open-day-sydney-hero-wrapper">
  <div class="page-width">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="flex-container">
        <div class="content">
          <h2>College Open Day - Sydney Campus</h2>
          <div class="paragraph">
            <p>Visit the Ella Baché College Sydney Campus where you will hear from our expert trainers, current students, enjoy a mini treatment and tour the college training rooms.</p>
          </div>
          <h4>On campus open days for 2023:</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>14 January 2023</li>
            <li>14 May 2023</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="paragraph">
            <p>Applications for our February 2023 on campus college intake are now open. Ella Bache have flexible study options with on campus intakes in February, June, September and November and online commencing each month.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="button-holder"><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com.au/e/ella-bache-college-open-day-january-2023-tickets-473729677217" class="btn btn-primary">Register Now</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="media">
          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2999/1646/files/virtual-info-session-hero-image.jpg?v=1670403576" loading="lazy" alt="Virtual Info Sessions">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .college-open-day-sydney-hero-wrapper{padding:60px 0;}
